TITLE Fe K-edge XANES calculation for FeO

* Calculation control
CONTROL
  iprint 3
  nleg 6
  rmax 6.0
END

* Calculation type
EXAFS
  kmax 20.0
END

XANES
  xkmax 10.0
  xkstep 0.05
END

* Absorbing atom
EDGE K
  s02 1.0
END

* Structure definition
ATOMS
* Absorbing atom
  0  Fe   0.0000   0.0000   0.0000   0
* Neighboring atoms
  1  O    2.1500   0.0000   0.0000   0
  2  O   -2.1500   0.0000   0.0000   0
  3  O    0.0000   2.1500   0.0000   0
  4  O    0.0000  -2.1500   0.0000   0
  5  O    0.0000   0.0000   2.1500   0
  6  O    0.0000   0.0000  -2.1500   0
END

* Temperature effects
DEBYE
  temp 300
  debye-temp 400
END

* Output control
PRINT
  path 1
  phase 1
  fmft 1
END
